## Recovery Strategy
1. Identify which actor(s) failed due to missing dependencies
2. Add appropriate provider(s) from available solutions above
3. Reorder plan so providers come before consumers
4. Verify all dependencies satisfied in correct sequence
5. Include dependency providers BEFORE dependent actors in new plan
6. Do not repeat same actor consecutively unless absolutely necessary

